{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22128","headline":"及第後归觐留别诸同年 · 白居易","name":"及第後归觐留别诸同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年常苦学，一上谬成名。\n擢第未爲贵，贺亲方始荣。\n时辈六七人，送我出帝城。\n轩车动行色，丝管举离声。\n得意减别恨，半酣轻远程。\n翩翩马蹄疾，春日归乡情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}